EXCLUDED: FONTS

No font file in this repository is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only or MIT,
whatever directory it is in. This applies to every .woff, .woff2, .ttf, .otf
and .eot file, including ones added after this notice was written. Each font
remains under its owner's own license, listed below. This repository grants
you no rights in them. To use one, get a license from its owner.

  ABC Monument Grotesk, ABC Monument Grotesk Mono,
  ABC Monument Grotesk Semi Mono, ABC Marist
      Owner:    Dinamo Typefaces (https://abcdinamo.com)
      License:  commercial, held by ENS Labs Limited for its own deployments
      Files:    apps/manager/public/og/fonts/
                apps/portal/src/assets/fonts/og/

The web font files (WOFF2) for these typefaces are not in this repository. The
apps load them at runtime from https://fonts.ens.dev, which serves them for ENS
Labs' own deployments only. The TrueType files listed above are the exception:
the Open Graph image renderer cannot read WOFF2.

If you build or deploy anything from this repository, you are responsible for
licensing any of these fonts you use, or for replacing them. That includes
pointing apps/*/src/styles/fonts.css at your own licensed copies rather than at
fonts.ens.dev.
